{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"紧支集直像"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"“紧支集直像”"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>紧支集直像 (direct image with compact support, 又叫紧支集前推) 是"},{"Local":{"url":"六函子","text":"六函子"}},{"Plain":"之一.</p>\n<p>对于局部紧 Hausdorff 空间 $X,Y$ 之间的映射 $f\\colon  X\\to Y$, 紧支集直像函子 $f_!$ 是"},{"Local":{"url":"直像","text":"直像"}},{"Plain":"函子 $f_*\\colon \\operatorname{Sh}(X)\\to\\operatorname{Sh}(Y)$ 的子函子. 对 $X$ 上的 "},{"Local":{"url":"Abel层","text":"Abel 层"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal F$, $f_!\\mathcal F$ 的截面是那些满足</p>\n"}]}}